msgstr "Status över dat \"Un&ified Messaging Center\" vun ICQ verföögbor maken"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, chkFileProxy)
#. +> trunk stable
#: protocols/oscar/icq/ui/icqeditaccountui.ui:594
msgid "Use AOL proxy server instead of direct connections. If you're behind a router that you don't control, you'll probably want this."
msgstr "En AOL-Proxyserver bruken, keen Direktverbinnen. Sittst Du achter en Nettweger, den Du nich instellen kannst, is dat en goot Idee."

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, chkFileProxy)
#. +> trunk stable
#: protocols/oscar/icq/ui/icqeditaccountui.ui:597
msgid "Use the AOL proxy server for things that would normally need a direct connection, like file transfers. You'll want this if there's a firewall or router that blocks connections to your computer and you can't get unblocked. If a direct connection fails, a proxy connection will be tried regardless of this setting."
msgstr "Den AOL-Proxyserver för Saken bruken, för de anners en Direktverbinnen noot deit, as Dateiöverdregen. Dat is denn goot, wenn Du achter en Nettdiek oder Nettweger sittst, de dat Tokoppeln na Dien Reekner verthöödt, un Du dat nich topassen kannst. Sleit en Direktverbinnen fehl, warrt so un so en Proxyverbinnen versöcht, liek wat hier instellt is."

